## 4. Suggested task breakdown

| # | Task | Module | Suggested size |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Set up Prisma schema + migrations + seed script | Foundation | M |
| 2 | Enterprise & user CRUD | 2.1 | M |
| 2b | Role & Permission CRUD + CASL ability builder + guard + `Super_Admin` bootstrap logic | 2.1 / 3.1 | L |
| 3 | Vehicle CRUD + list/filter/search + detail view | 2.2 | M |
| 4 | Garage CRUD | 2.3 | S |
| 5 | Contract CRUD + active-contract lookup + expiry list | 2.3 | M |
| 6 | Repair request creation + submit flow | 2.4 | M |
| 7 | Approval/rejection flow + status history/audit trail | 2.4 | L |
| 8 | Billing creation + contract discount logic | 2.5 | M |
| 9 | Auto-create expense from billing (transactional) | 2.5 / 2.6 | M |
| 10 | Manual expense entry form + category management | 2.6 | S |
| 11 | Per-vehicle report view | 2.7 | M |
| 12 | Per-enterprise dashboard | 2.7 | M |
| 13 | CSV export | 2.7 | S |

(S = a day or two, M = a few days, L = a week+. Adjust to your intern's pace and start them on task 1 + 4, the lowest-risk pieces, before handing over the approval workflow.)

